{"candidateAnswer":"photography workshop, martial arts classes","evidence":"[D13:6 | 4:30 pm on 13 June, 2022] James: It can be rough getting started, but I'm sure you'll do great. Don't be afraid to seek help if you need it. Can't wait to hear about your experience! By the way, I recently started a course that combines my passion for gaming and programming. It's fun and challenging, and it has definitely increased my excitement for both.\n[D23:13 | 9:23 pm on 4 September, 2022] James: Yes, two days ago I signed up for a cooking class. I never liked cooking, but I felt that I wanted to learn something new. At the first lesson we prepared several simple dishes. I got a great omelette the first time!","itemId":"urn:uuid:d029ef66-db4a-5b64-9841-ddd3966cc7d8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d0b7c0bacc41a48fe44fe1ed09432c8e70b0c85fe23ef6b0653ae60cfbb9164d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of classes has James joined?","referenceAnswer":"game design course, cooking classes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d0b7c0bacc41a48fe44fe1ed09432c8e70b0c85fe23ef6b0653ae60cfbb9164d"}}]}